TITLE Pure water pH 7, 150C, eq with chrysotile and talc; report specific conductance
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals Mg Si
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
